---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Pokoly Studio - Zero-Cost High Performance Browser Games"
  description="Learn about the engineering philosophy behind Pokoly: client-side WebGL, zero-cost edge hosting, and instant access."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm space-y-6">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-black text-white">About Pokoly Studio</h1>
    <p class="text-base text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      Pokoly was engineered with a radical goal: <strong class="text-white">eliminate everything that makes web gaming painful.</strong>
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-6">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-card/50 p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">🏎 100% Client-Side Execution</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-400">
          Every frame, physics calculation, and sound effect is generated in real-time by your device using modern HTML5 Canvas, WebGL, and the Web Audio API. This means zero lag, zero wait times, and 60 FPS fluidity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-card/50 p-5">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-white text-base">🌐 Subdomain Architecture</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-400">
          Rather than forcing players into cumbersome app stores or crowded directories, each game lives on its own dedicated subdomain (e.g. words.pokoly.com, fruits.pokoly.com) for bookmarking.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mt-8">Engineering Stack</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-400">
      <li><strong>Astro 5+ Static Compiler:</strong> Pre-renders 100% semantic static HTML for 100/100 Core Web Vitals.</li>
      <li><strong>Procedural Sound Synthesizer:</strong> Zero bytes of external MP3 audio asset downloads.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare Edge CDN:</strong> Cached across 300+ cities globally with sub-20ms first-byte response time.</li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
